WEBVTT

00:13:29.236 --> 00:13:32.036
and require more transparency
from both this industry

00:13:32.036 --> 00:13:34.436
and other industries in this transition.

00:13:34.476 --> 00:13:35.756
LL: Thank you, thank you.

00:13:35.796 --> 00:13:36.996
BOS: Thank you.

00:13:36.996 --> 00:13:39.356
(Applause)